,"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code and documentation look good to me. Note that I didn't test the XR part, so testing on that front is still welcome.\r\n\r\nI can confirm negative colors are gone when using HDR 2D and debanding, in the MRP from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108526:\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"867\" height=\"647\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250711_200733\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22a9fa28-a5c1-4dc5-8b0f-0554b11c0afa\" /> | <img width=\"810\" height=\"646\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250711_200821\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8c074b3-9d62-4fcc-95f8-2adceed20fc8\" />\r\n\r\nACES and AgX still exhibit negative colors, but from the discussion we had on the chat, this is fine to leave as-is.\r\n\r\nACES | AgX\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"771\" height=\"648\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eddb16b6-b0bf-4504-ab2b-ada4b8109f7f\" /> | <img width=\"771\" height=\"648\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1439c6de-393f-4fef-ac48-e6657fff5069\" />\r\n\r\nNote that this PR does not make debanding more effective in the Mobile renderer (this would require higher debanding strength as I understand it).","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107782#pullrequestreview-3011432576","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107782","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107782#pullrequestreview-3011432576"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107782"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-11T18:13:46Z","commit_id":"a1591512f8c3a211b5fc94770fd64e3dbc825630"}]